Subject: Set StartupWMClass in dolphin's desktop entry to its desktop id, org.kde.dolphin

Dolphin's Wayland app_id is its desktop file name, org.kde.dolphin, and
upstream's shorter class matches no window Dolphin opens.

--- a/src/org.kde.dolphin.desktop
+++ b/src/org.kde.dolphin.desktop
@@ -227,4 +227,4 @@
 Keywords[zh_TW]=files;file management;file browsing;samba;network shares;Explorer;Finder;檔案總管;檔案管理員;檔案;
 X-DBUS-ServiceName=org.kde.dolphin
 X-KDE-Shortcuts=Meta+E
-StartupWMClass=dolphin
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.dolphin
